<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang='en-US'><head><meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"/><script>window['ec:pageId']='11117807979912999358'</script><title>CFP</title><link href="/images/favicon.ico" rel="icon" type="image/jpeg"/><link href="/css/cool.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<link href="/css/cfp/classic.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<link href="/css/menu_cfp.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<script src="/js/easy.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/menu.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/form.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/inplace.js?version=545"></script><script>EC.version='545'</script></head>
<body><table class="page" id="page"><tr style="height:1px"><td><table class="header"><tr><td class="logocell"><a href="/" title="EasyChair home page"><img class="leftlogo" src="/images/logoEC_short.png"/></a></td><td class="rolecell">EasyChair Smart CFP</td><td style="width: 99%"></td><td class="helplink"><a class="toplinks" href="/docs/home" title="User guide">User guide</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr style="height:99%"><td class="menu_and_content"><div class="menu" id="menu0"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="menu" style="position:static; visibility:visible"><tr><td class="top" id="menu1" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu1','/cfp',{&quot;a&quot;:null})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu1')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu1')" title="Main page">Home</td><td class="top" id="menu2" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu2','/cfp/choose',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu2')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu2')" title="Create a new CFP">New CFP</td><td class="top" id="menu3" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu3','/cfp/all',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu3')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu3')" title="Manage my CFPs">My CFPs</td><td class="top" id="menu4" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu4','/cfp/watchlist',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu4')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu4')" title="My CFP watchlist">Watchlist</td></tr></table></div><div class="search_row" id="cfp:search:row"><form action="/cfp/search" id="search-form"><input id="search-input" name="query" placeholder="Search" type="text"/></form></div><div class="summary"><div class="pagetitle">CFP</div></div><div class="content" id="content"><div class="subcontent"><div id="cfp" style="clear:right"><table class="title_table"><tr><td class="logocell"><img src="/images/cfp-logo/AIGC2026.jpg?id=1895532568"/></td><td class="titlecell"><div id="cfptitle">AIGC 2026: The 4th International Conference on AI-Generated Content</div><div id="cfpvenue">Guangzhou, China</div><div id="cfpdateplace">Guangzhou, China, December 26-27, 2026</div></td></tr></table><table class="date_table"><tr><td>Conference web page</td><td><a href="https://www.icaigc.org" target="_blank">https://www.icaigc.org</a></td></tr><tr><td>Submission deadline</td><td>November 28, 2026</td></tr></table><div class="topics">Topics: <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=43269638" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_navy bg_seagreenlight">foundations of generative intelligence</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=43269639" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_black bg_wheat">multimodal generation and creative ai</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=43269640" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_navy bg_bluelight">intelligent agents and ai applications</span></a></div><p><strong>The </strong><strong>4</strong><strong><sup>th</sup></strong><strong> International Conference on AI-</strong><strong><span style="font-family:Calibri">G</span></strong><strong>enerated Content (AIGC 202</strong><strong>6</strong><strong>)</strong></p><p><strong>December 26–27, 2026 | Guangzhou, China</strong><br/><a href="https://www.icaigc.org"><u>https://www.icaigc.org</u></a></p><p> </p><p>The 4<sup>th</sup> International Conference on AI-<span style="font-family:Calibri">G</span>enerated Content (AIGC 2026) will be held in Guangzhou, China, on December 26–27, 2026. Following the successful editions in Shanghai (2023), Beijing (2024), and Hangzhou (2025), AIGC has established itself as a growing international forum for researchers, engineers, and industry practitioners in the field of AI-generated content.</p><p> </p><p>AIGC 2026 continues this tradition by promoting interdisciplinary exchange and bridging advances in generative artificial intelligence, multimodal foundation models, and real-world applications. The conference welcomes contributions that address both theoretical innovations and practical applications, and provides a high-quality platform to explore the future directions of AI-generated content technologies.</p><p> </p><p><strong>Conference Information</strong></p><p><strong>Conference Name:</strong><strong> </strong>The 4<sup>th</sup> International Conference on AI-<span style="font-family:Calibri">G</span>enerated Content (AIGC 2026)</p><p><strong>Conference </strong><strong><span style="font-family:Calibri">Date</span></strong><strong>:</strong> December 26–27, 2026</p><p><strong>V</strong><strong><span style="font-family:Calibri">enue</span></strong><strong>:</strong> Guangzhou, China</p><p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.icaigc.org"><u>https://www.icaigc.org</u></a></p><p> </p><p><strong>Topics of interest for submission include, but are not limited to:</strong></p><p>Artificial General Intelligence</p><p>Generative AI</p><p>AI-generated Audio</p><p>AI-generated Art</p><p>AI-generated Drug</p><p>AI-generated Image</p><p>AI-generated Text</p><p>AI-generated Video</p><p>AI-generated 3D Object</p><p>Natural Language Processing (NLP)</p><p>Text-to-Image</p><p>Machine Learning</p><p>Generative Adversarial Networks</p><p>Computer Vision</p><p>Deep Learning</p><p>Diffusion Models for Machine Learning</p><p>Transformer Neural Networks</p><p> </p><p><strong>CONFERENCE PUBLICATION</strong></p><p>All accepted and presented papers will be <span style="font-family:Calibri">featured</span> in the <strong>AIGC 2026 Conference Proceedings</strong>, which will be published by <strong>SPIE</strong><span style="font-family:Calibri">.</span> The publisher will submit the proceedings for indexing in <strong>EI Compendex, Scopus</strong>, and Google Scholar.</p><p> </p><p><strong>PAPER SUBMISSION</strong></p><p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:contact@icaigc.org"><u>contact@icaigc.org</u></a><br/>Please choose either to submit your papers.</p><p> </p><p><strong>Important Dates</strong></p><p>Submission Deadline: Nov. 28, 2026 (AoE)<br/>Notification Date: in two weeks after submission<br/>Registration Due: Dec. 10, 2026</p><p>Conference Date: December 26–27, 2026</p><p> </p><p><strong>CONTACT US</strong></p><p><strong>Conference Secretary:</strong> <span style="font-family:Calibri">Ms</span>. Ji<br/><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:contact@icaigc.org"><u>contact@icaigc.org</u></a><br/><strong>Tel</strong><strong>/WeChat:</strong> 15618780723</p></div></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class="footer">Copyright © 2002 – 2026 EasyChair</td></tr></table></body></html>
